{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics, chaos, and a lot of crashes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Cresta</strong> is a physics-driven obstacle and stunt game where cars flip, spin, and explode in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through wild tracks, survive ridiculous challenges, and try to keep control \u2014 or just embrace the chaos with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, crash, and flip through crazy stunt courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in ramps, loops, seesaws, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new vehicles with different strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mayhem: team up, chain cars together, or even control one wheel each</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase high scores\u2026 or just enjoy the challenge</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077590?t=1762252408","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077590?t=1762252408","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077590/b1644b9b4995d37eaa16fef8f572ad9399a174b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762252408","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077590/b1644b9b4995d37eaa16fef8f572ad9399a174b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762252408","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detai